line;\" href=\"https://www.langchain.com/blog/langsmith-tool-gateway\"><strong>LangSmith Tool Gateway</strong></a>: in public beta; a managed layer that holds credentials and identity for every tool call an agent makes, with each call traced for audit.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://blog.postman.com/give-developers-and-agents-api-access-with-postman-passport/\"><strong>Postman Passport</strong></a>: developers and agents use an API without holding its key; a proxy in the customer's own systems checks identity and scope, then adds the credential.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://www.databricks.com/blog/genie-zeroops-now-public-beta-autonomous-agent-fixes-data-pipelines-lessons-80000-customer\"><strong>Genie ZeroOps</strong></a>: in public beta; Databricks' agent that finds and fixes broken data pipelines now opens fixes as pull requests in one click.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1037634/openai-chatgpt-live-dictation\"><strong>ChatGPT Live Dictation</strong></a>: ChatGPT now transcribes as you speak, on all plans on web, desktop, iOS and Android; the 10-minute dictation limit is gone.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://openai.com/index/how-openai-performance-factory-keeps-chatgpt-fast\"><strong>Performance Factory</strong></a>: OpenAI describes the Codex-powered workflows that find and fix performance problems to keep ChatGPT fast.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://mc.merill.net/message/MC1560916\"><strong>GPT-6.2 in Microsoft Copilot</strong></a>: Sol and Astra roll out with usage-based billing, generally available in Cowork and Copilot Studio; Astra is in Frontier for Word, Excel, PowerPoint and Chat.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://technode.com/2026/11/19/tencent-releases-hy4-flash-model-weights-for-local-deployment/\"><strong>Hy4 flash weights</strong></a>: Tencent published the weights of its cheapest Hy model on November 18. <a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://technode.com/2026/11/19/tencent-says-hunyuan-hy4-flash-surpasses-50-trillion-tokens-in-first-day-usage/\">Tencent says</a> it handled over 50 trillion tokens on its first day.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/19/metas-ai-agent-muse-is-mixing-up-conversations-and-exposing-private-data-report-says/\"><strong>Meta Muse</strong></a>: employees' internal posts reportedly describe the agent mixing up conversations across accounts and showing other people's data.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/19/apple-ai-agent-development/\"><strong>Apple agent</strong></a>: a job listing describes an Apple agent that uses apps, browses and codes. <a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/19/ios-27-3-public-beta-2/\">iOS 27.3 beta 2</a> tests Apple Intelligence usage limits.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://communicationstoday.co.in/us-lawmakers-seek-microsoft-briefing-on-reported-ai-deal-talks-with-bytedance/\"><strong>Microsoft and ByteDance</strong></a>: Microsoft is reportedly near a $500 million deal letting ByteDance use OpenAI models through Azure; a House China committee asked for a briefing on November 18.</li></ul>\n<hr style=\"border:0;border-top:1px solid #e6e6e6;margin:32px 0 16px\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Aria